#5000
everything mobile flags~
the mobile with every flag~
A mobile carrying every action and affection bit at once stands here.
~
   Both bit fields on this mobile are the full 32 the C can represent.
Its hit dice and damage dice are at the extremes sscanf will read: the
format embeds the 'd' and the '+' as literals, so a negative bonus
cannot be written at all, and these are the largest that fit.
~
abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEF abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEF -1000 S
34 -10 -100 30d30+30000 20d20+2000
2000000000 2000000000
8 8 2
#5001
enhanced especs mobile~
the enhanced mobile~
A mobile with an espec for every ability is here, being enhanced.
~
   parse_enhanced_mob reads 'Key: Value' lines until an 'E' on its own.
interpret_espec splits on the first colon and treats a line with no
colon as a keyword with no value, so both shapes are here.
~
ab 0 0 E
1 20 10 1d1+1 1d1+0
0 1
8 8 0
BareHandAttack: 12
Str: 18
StrAdd: 100
Int: 18
Wis: 18
Dex: 18
Con: 18
Cha: 18
NoColonKeyword
E
