#5150
stray mobile~
the stray mobile~
A mobile no zone's range claims stands here.
~
   #5150 is above zone 50's top of 5099 and above every other range, so
nothing claims it. It belongs in zone 50's file -- the zone whose range
begins nearest below it -- and a writer that sent every unclaimed record
to the lowest zone instead would put it in zone 49's and reverse the
mobile table, which is what makes it worth having rather than merely
present.
   Last in the file, for real_object's reason above: the table is
binary-searched, so it has to ascend.
~
a 0 0 S
5 10 0 2d8+10 1d4+1
0 100
8 8 0
$
